    "description": "### Impact\r\nAnyone able to run a parameterized Data Explorer query (including non-staff members of a group a query is shared with) could craft parameter values that escaped the intended query and executed arbitrary SQL. Queries run in a read-only transaction, so data could not be modified but any table could be read.\r\n\r\n### Patches\r\nUpgrade to the patched version.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nDisable Data Explorer or limit access to only trusted users.",
